00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.870
So we have a lot of similarities
in our methods, but, uh, that's,

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.010
that's, that's what's going on.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.850
So now we've got this Goluremi Language
YouTube channel and TikTok that's

