Exactly.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.910
It's a team...

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:05.490
it is.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:06.090
It is.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:06.360
It is.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.230
You guys are coming up.

